{
    "title": "MyTransit NYC Subway & MTA Bus",
    "description": "<h2>NEW YORK\u2019S MOST ACCURATE TRANSIT APP</h2>\r\n<u>MyTransit</u> is the most reliable NYC Subway, Bus, LIRR Long Island, Metro-North and MTA transit tracker app with maps, live arrival times, schedules, directions, and alerts. \r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f 4.7 <b>Top rated NYC transit app</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfd MyTransit is New York City\u2019s transit app with popular features like NYC Subway Map, MTA Bus Time, Train Time for LIRR Long Island Railroad and Metro North, and other features not found in MYmta app. The Subway section includes NYC maps, MTA Subway Time, schedules, directions and alerts so you never miss a beat. Our Bus features include NYC Bus Time, route maps, and MTA bus tracker for all boroughs of New York City with Manhattan, Brooklyn, Bronx, Queens, and Staten Island. Rail section covers MTA\u2019s New York railroads Metro-North and Long Island Railroad LIRR.\r\n\r\n<b>On-time, <u>every</u> time!</b> Whether you are a native New Yorker, a commuter living in NYC, or a tourist looking to explore the city, MyTransit is your go-to New York City transit app for reliable commuting and traveling. Our transit tracker and map app simplifies your commute and gives accurate info when you need it.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude87 <b>NYC Subway Map, Times and Directions:</b> Looking for MTA subway map and accurate MTA subway time in your NYC transit app? Get all that in our NYC metro subway section. Besides the real-time NYC subway train schedule, there are high-resolution NY subway maps including Day Service and Night Service maps.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude8c <b> NYC Bus Time and Maps:</b> Need to access MTA Bus Time with tracker and maps? With MyTransit\u2019s NYC bus tracker app, you will get alerted if there are status changes, delays or alerts (just enable transit and safety alerts). NYC MTA bus network covers all 5 boroughs of New York City including: Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx and Staten Island bus routes.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude88 <b>LIRR Long Island Railroad:</b> Its essential to access LIRR times and schedules when commuting on the Long Island Railroad. MyTransit app covers New York MTA\u2019s entire rail network and gives real-time arrivals, schedules and LIRR map, so you can plan your commute smartly and avoid delays. Ability to buy LIRR tickets will be coming soon. Includes Grand Central Madison changes.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude86<b>Metro-North Railroad:</b> Navigate Metro-North Railroad in New York with ease using MyTransit app. Access Metro-North real-time arrivals, track number, schedules, MTA rail maps and alerts.\r\n<h3>MyTransit App Features</h3>\r\n\ud83d\udea9 <b>Live NYC Transit Status \u2013 Subway, Bus, Rail</b>\r\nQuickly check delays, service changes and live transit status of NYC subway, MTA buses, LIRR Long Island Railroad and Metro North. <i>Know before you go!</i>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd52 <b>Schedules and Realtime Arrivals</b>\r\nLooking for NYC Subway Time, MTA Bus Time, Metro North Schedule or LIRR Train Time? Just head to MyTransit app\u2019s \u201cSchedules\u201d tab to access real time arrivals & schedules of entire New York transit network operated by the Metropolitan Transportation Authority (MTA).\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <b>Transit Maps</b>\r\nComprehensive collection of NYC transit maps officially licensed from MTA. NYC Subway maps include day and night-time service, accessible stations, and winter weather map. MTA bus maps cover all 5 boroughs of New York City Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx and Staten Island. Railroad maps include LIRR Long Island Railroad, Metro-North, connections to PATH and NJ Transit lines.\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f <b>Transit and Safety Alerts</b>\r\nStay safe and informed about transit changes and disruptions happening around you. \r\n\r\n\u21aa\ufe0f <b>Directions and Trip Planner</b>\r\nEasy to follow, step-by-step directions and timely information for navigating New York City public transit with ease and confidence.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea2<b>NYC Ferry and NY Waterway:</b> coming soon.\r\n\r\n<b>Commuting in New York is easy with MyTransit App</b> - Have all New York public transit info in your pocket right next to your MetroCard or OMNY card!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 https://www.MyTrans.it\r\n\ud83d\udce7 info@MyTrans.it",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h2>NEW YORK\u2019S MOST ACCURATE TRANSIT APP</h2><br><u>MyTransit</u> is the most reliable NYC Subway, Bus, LIRR Long Island, Metro-North and MTA transit tracker app with maps, live arrival times, schedules, directions, and alerts. <br><br>\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f 4.7 <b>Top rated NYC transit app</b><br><br>\ud83d\uddfd MyTransit is New York City\u2019s transit app with popular features like NYC Subway Map, MTA Bus Time, Train Time for LIRR Long Island Railroad and Metro North, and other features not found in MYmta app. The Subway section includes NYC maps, MTA Subway Time, schedules, directions and alerts so you never miss a beat. Our Bus features include NYC Bus Time, route maps, and MTA bus tracker for all boroughs of New York City with Manhattan, Brooklyn, Bronx, Queens, and Staten Island. Rail section covers MTA\u2019s New York railroads Metro-North and Long Island Railroad LIRR.<br><br><b>On-time, <u>every</u> time!</b> Whether you are a native New Yorker, a commuter living in NYC, or a tourist looking to explore the city, MyTransit is your go-to New York City transit app for reliable commuting and traveling. Our transit tracker and map app simplifies your commute and gives accurate info when you need it.<br><br>\ud83d\ude87 <b>NYC Subway Map, Times and Directions:</b> Looking for MTA subway map and accurate MTA subway time in your NYC transit app? Get all that in our NYC metro subway section. Besides the real-time NYC subway train schedule, there are high-resolution NY subway maps including Day Service and Night Service maps.<br><br>\ud83d\ude8c <b> NYC Bus Time and Maps:</b> Need to access MTA Bus Time with tracker and maps? With MyTransit\u2019s NYC bus tracker app, you will get alerted if there are status changes, delays or alerts (just enable transit and safety alerts). NYC MTA bus network covers all 5 boroughs of New York City including: Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx and Staten Island bus routes.<br><br>\ud83d\ude88 <b>LIRR Long Island Railroad:</b> Its essential to access LIRR times and schedules when commuting on the Long Island Railroad. MyTransit app covers New York MTA\u2019s entire rail network and gives real-time arrivals, schedules and LIRR map, so you can plan your commute smartly and avoid delays. Ability to buy LIRR tickets will be coming soon. Includes Grand Central Madison changes.<br><br>\ud83d\ude86<b>Metro-North Railroad:</b> Navigate Metro-North Railroad in New York with ease using MyTransit app. Access Metro-North real-time arrivals, track number, schedules, MTA rail maps and alerts.<br><h3>MyTransit App Features</h3><br>\ud83d\udea9 <b>Live NYC Transit Status \u2013 Subway, Bus, Rail</b><br>Quickly check delays, service changes and live transit status of NYC subway, MTA buses, LIRR Long Island Railroad and Metro North. <i>Know before you go!</i><br><br>\ud83d\udd52 <b>Schedules and Realtime Arrivals</b><br>Looking for NYC Subway Time, MTA Bus Time, Metro North Schedule or LIRR Train Time? Just head to MyTransit app\u2019s \u201cSchedules\u201d tab to access real time arrivals &amp; schedules of entire New York transit network operated by the Metropolitan Transportation Authority (MTA).<br><br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <b>Transit Maps</b><br>Comprehensive collection of NYC transit maps officially licensed from MTA. NYC Subway maps include day and night-time service, accessible stations, and winter weather map. MTA bus maps cover all 5 boroughs of New York City Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx and Staten Island. Railroad maps include LIRR Long Island Railroad, Metro-North, connections to PATH and NJ Transit lines.<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <b>Transit and Safety Alerts</b><br>Stay safe and informed about transit changes and disruptions happening around you. <br><br>\u21aa\ufe0f <b>Directions and Trip Planner</b><br>Easy to follow, step-by-step directions and timely information for navigating New York City public transit with ease and confidence.<br><br>\ud83d\udea2<b>NYC Ferry and NY Waterway:</b> coming soon.<br><br><b>Commuting in New York is easy with MyTransit App</b> - Have all New York public transit info in your pocket right next to your MetroCard or OMNY card!<br><br><br>\ud83c\udf10 https://www.MyTrans.it<br>\ud83d\udce7 info@MyTrans.it",
